  "scope": "Automatic order-preserving projection target discovery over all 19,841 current-policy acquired formulas. Twenty-three adaptively selected unresolved frontier sources and one known positive control, without target identifiers or reference answers supplied to search. Three alternating repetitions compare indexed lookup with scanning the same prepared signature catalog, including exact bridge checking. Preparation, persistence and independent cold validation are recorded separately. Full cold index validation checks exact membership and every minimal set using an independent subset scan. All old solver and reference rows are unchanged; no states are admitted. Indexed lookup savings do not establish total expansion savings, a fresh holdout result, peak-RAM reduction, minimum-cost expansion or an unrestricted SAT bound. The selected 36-variable projection is only a proposal and remains unacquired.",
